(I remember sitting in church basements years ago, convinced that my history disqualified me from ever doing) Tj
T* (anything good again. The wreckage of addiction, ruined relationships, and shame was too deep. I thought God only) Tj
T* (worked through the clean, polished people who had never fallen.) Tj
