/F9 11 Tf
15.9499999999999993 TL
0.169 g
48. 596.5 Td
(There was a morning during my fourth step inventory when I realized something that shattered my despair: God) Tj
T* (doesn't call the qualified; He qualifies the called. In Isaiah 6, the prophet was terrified because of his unclean lips) Tj
T* (before God touched him with an altar coal. God didn't discard him. He sent him.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11 Tf
15.9499999999999993 TL
0.169 g
48. 536. Td
(My journey taught me that your deepest wound is often where your greatest ministry begins. When you survive the) Tj
T* (furnace, you become someone who can guide others through the flames. You don't have to be a spiritual giant or) Tj
T* (have everything figured out. You just have to be willing to say, "Here am I; send me.") Tj
